<title>USA: ADVISORY-ICI money market funds data now due Fri.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY-ICI money market funds data now due Fri.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weekly retail money market mutual funds report from the Investment Company Institute would be delayed until Friday, a spokeswoman said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The ICI had originally hoped to release the report on Wednesday, a day early, ahead of the Thanksgiving Day holiday on Thursday.</p>
